<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon adjusts recommended lists.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon adjusts recommended lists.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said U.S. equity strategist David Shulman made changes to the firm's recommended lists.</p>
<p>-- removed Hewlett-Packard Co from large-capitalizaiton recommended list, citing 116.7 percent gain since the stock was added to list on December 20, 1994.</p>
<p>-- added Thermo Electron Corp to the list, saying he views the company as a &quot;significant play&quot; on increased environmental spending coming from the reauthorization of the Clean Air and Water Acts next year.  </p>
<p>-- removed Fusion Systems Corp from Salomon's small-cap recommended list, while adding Philip Environmental Inc.</p>
